<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.AFRICA DECIDUOUS FRUIT BOARD NEW MEMBER NAMED.</title>
<headline>S.AFRICA DECIDUOUS FRUIT BOARD NEW MEMBER NAMED.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Agriculture Minister Derek Hanekom has appointed Maleen Hoekstra to represent producers of deciduous fruit for export on the Deciduous Fruit Board, the National Agricultural Marketing Council said on Monday.</p>
<p>It said in a statement that her term of office will be until December 31, 1997 or until the Board is disbanded, whichever comes first.</p>
<p>Following the Marketing of Agricultural Products Bill last year all commodity control boards are to be closed down.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
